ick.Teams is new to your company’s Microsoft environment, your IT policy could prevent new apps from connecting without admin approval."},{cat:"Iristick.Teams",title:"Iristick.Teams asks for admin approval before use",description:"Some companies have strict IT security policies. If you can’t approve the permissions yourself, your IT admin will receive a request to approve Iristick.Teams."},{cat:"Iristick.Teams",title:"How to approve an application?",description:"If admin approval is required, follow Microsoft's guide: \u003Ca style='text-decoration:underline;' href='https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/enterprise-apps/review-admin-consent-requests' >Review Admin Consent Requests\u003C/a>."},{cat:"Iristick.Teams",title:"Can I install this application On-Premise?",description:"Yes, we offer a Self-Hosted solution for full control. Most users download the app from the Play Store, where we handle updates and maintenance. If you prefer to manage everything internally, on-premise installation is possible. Contact us through the chat or at support@iristick.com for more details."}],collector:[{cat:"Iristick.Collector",title:"Why should I pick Iristick.Collector",description:"If you regularly collect data that needs digitization, Iristick.Collector helps you do it faster, hands-free, and with seamless syncing—boosting efficiency and accuracy."},{cat:"Iristick.Collector",title:"Phone Requirements",description:"Iristick.Collector supports both iOS and Android. On iOS, you need iOS 17+ on iPhone 11 and newer. Or, for Android you will need at least Android 8."},{cat:"Iristick.Collector",title:"Getting Started",description:"Schedule a demo or reach out via chat to get started. You can test the app without smart glasses, but it’s designed for hands-free efficiency."},{cat:"Iristick.Collector",title:"Functionalities",description:"Collect data hands-free—pictures, voice, numbers, barcodes—at high speed. All data syncs to your account for access via the portal."},{cat:"Iristick.Collector",title:"Licensing",description:"We’re finalizing licensing details. Contact us for the latest information."}],assist:[{cat:"Iristick.Assist",title:"Why should I pick Iristick.Assist",description:"Because it's simple. The easiest setup ever—just connect and start a one-on-one call to get your issue fixed fast."},{cat:"Iristick.Assist",title:"Phone Requirements",description:"Currently available on Android. iOS support is coming soon."},{cat:"Iristick.Assist",title:"Getting Started",description:"Download the Iristick.Assist app from the Play Store and connect your Iristick smart glasses. No account needed—that's it!"},{cat:"Iristick.Assist",title:"Functionalities",description:"Just connect, talk, and see what the other person sees. No complications, just fast and easy remote support."},{cat:"Iristick.Assist",title:"Licensing",description:"For now, it's free. If that changes, we'll let you know."}],g2:[{cat:"G2",title:"What's in the Box?",description:"The Iristick.G2 package includes smart glasses, a pocket unit (Android or iOS), a battery charger, a USB-C cable, a magnetic plate, and a protective case."},{cat:"G2",title:"Using the smart glasses",description:"Connect the smart glasses to the pocket unit via the provided coax cable. The pocket unit then connects to your smartphone via USB-C or lightning if it's an older iPhone, utilizing the phone’s processing power for optimal performance."},{cat:"G2",title:"Charging",description:"Charge the pocket unit with the included charger and cable. A full charge takes approximately 2 hours. Hot-swapping batteries ensures uninterrupted use."},{cat:"G2",title:"Why is it cabled?",description:"The cable design ensures maximum performance and extended battery life by offloading processing to the smartphone. It also reduces heat, weight and radiation near the temples."},{cat:"G2",title:"Left eye and right eye compatibility",description:"The 3-axis adjustable display allows for comfortable positioning, making the glasses adaptable to different users. However, the Iristick.G2 work better for right eye dominant people as the HUD is positioned in front of your right eye. "},{cat:"G2",title:"What if I'm wearing prescription glasses?",description:"The Iristick.G2 is compatible with prescription lenses through insert, ensuring a clear and comfortable user experience."},{cat:"G2",title:"What if I'm wearing PPE?",description:"Designed to resemble regular glasses, the Iristick.G2 can be comfortably worn alongside other PPE and is a safety certified smart glasses."}],g3:[{cat:"G3",title:"What's in the Box?",description:"The G3 package includes the smart safety glasses, a USB-C cable, and a protective case. Everything you need to connect to your smartphone and start working right away. A magnetic prescription insert is available separately as an optional accessory."},{cat:"G3",title:"Using the smart glasses",description:"Connect the G3 to your smartphone with the included USB-C cable. Your phone provides processing power, connectivity, and app access. Just plug in, open your Iristick compatible app, and you’re ready to work."},{cat:"G3",title:"Charging",description:"The G3 doesn’t need separate charging. All power comes directly from your smartphone through the cable. Extend your runtime by topping up your phone with a wireless power bank while in use."},{cat:"G3",title:"Why is it cabled?",description:"The cable keeps weight and heat off your head while delivering stable power and high performance. Your smartphone handles processing, networking, and app installation, while the glasses stay light, cool, and comfortable."},{cat:"G3",title:"Left eye and right eye compatibility",description:"The G3 is available in both right-eye and left-eye versions. Each device is manufactured and configured for one specific eye — you select the version at the time of order. The right-eye model is the standard configuration and ships from stock. The left-eye variant is available on request but comes with a longer lead time. Choose the version that matches your dominant eye or your working environment before ordering."},{cat:"G3",title:"What if I'm wearing prescription glasses?",description:"The G3 is compatible with a magnetic prescription insert, available as a separate accessory. Take the insert to your optician to have your lenses fitted, then attach it magnetically to the frame. This keeps the device shareable between users — each user can carry their own personalised insert while using the same pair of glasses."},{cat:"G3",title:"What if I'm wearing PPE?",description:"The compact frame resembles standard safety glasses and works with most PPE setups used in manufacturing, healthcare, agriculture, and field environments."},{cat:"G3",title:"Does it work with iPhones and Android devices?",description:"The G3 connects via USB-C to supported iOS and Android phones. All apps are installed and updated through the Apple App Store or Google Play on your phone."}],h1:[{cat:"H1",title:"What's in the Box?",description:"The Iristick.H1 package includes smart glasses, a pocket unit (Android or iOS), a battery charger, a USB-C cable, a magnetic plate, a protective case and an Iristick headband or helmet."},{cat:"H1",title:"Using the smart glasses",description:"Connect the smart glasses to the pocket unit via the provided coax cable. The pocket unit then connects to your smartphone via USB-C or lightning if it's an older iPhone, utilizing the phone’s processing power for optimal performance."},{cat:"H1",title:"Charging",description:"Charge the pocket unit using the included charger and USB-C cable. A full charge takes about 2 hours. Hot-swapping batteries allows continuous operation."},{cat:"H1",title:"Why is it cabled?",description:"The cabled design ensures high performance and extended battery life by offloading processing to the smartphone. This also reduces heat, weight and radiation near the head."},{cat:"H1",title:"Left eye and right eye compatibility",description:"The Iristick.H1 features an adjustable display for both left and right eye dominance, ensuring optimal usability for all users."},{cat:"H1",title:"What if I'm wearing prescription glasses?",description:"The Iristick.H1 can be used in combination with existing prescription glasses, allowing seamless integration with personal eyewear."},{cat:"H1",title:"What if I'm wearing PPE?",description:"The Iristick.H1 is designed for easy attachment to PPE such as helmets and headbands, ensuring safety compliance while using the device."}]},uses:{}}],
